# --- Algebra classes → Lean mathlib (structural formalization, by reference) #
# The typeclass hierarchy and the root-system / Lie formalizations aligned to their
# mathlib4 declarations. mathlib is Apache-2.0 but not RDF-projectable, so this is
# structural-by-reference (skos:relatedMatch), NOT identity: the Lean formalization is
# a related resource, not an invertible identity. All URLs curl-validated (HTTP 200).

gmeow:eqMathMonoidMathlib a gmeow:TermEquivalence ;
    gmeow:alignSubject math:Monoid ;
    gmeow:alignPredicate skos:relatedMatch ;
    gmeow:alignObject <https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Defs.html> ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.9 ;
    gmeow:objectLabel "Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Defs (Monoid)" ;
    gmeow:comment "math:Monoid is formalized by the Monoid typeclass in mathlib's Algebra.Group.Defs. Structural formalization by reference (mathlib is Apache-2.0 but not RDF), so skos:relatedMatch." ;
